# Base URL of the FastAPI backend (no trailing slash).
#
# Leave this UNCOMMENTED-as-blank in dev: requests go to the same origin
# (e.g. http://localhost:5173) and Vite proxies /auth, /users, /categories...
# to 127.0.0.1:8000 (see vite.config.ts). Same-origin cookie auth just works
# and there is no CORS to trip over.
#
# Only set it when the API is NOT on 127.0.0.1:8000 or you are NOT using the
# dev proxy (e.g. a production build). When set, the backend CORS must allow
# your exact origin AND allow_credentials must be True.
# VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
